{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Two players. One stone. One summit.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pyramidion is a 2-player co-op physics challenge built entirely around coordination, timing, and trust. Together, you must haul a massive stone block from the base of a monolithic pyramid all the way to its summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step upward is a test of communication. Every mistake is paid for in momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/075a162e510fd939c4673caf7a3bbe71.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/075a162e510fd939c4673caf7a3bbe71.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/075a162e510fd939c4673caf7a3bbe71.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Distinct Roles, Shared Responsibility</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player takes on a unique role, and success depends on how well you combine your abilities. There is no solo play here. Progress only happens when both players act as one.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Worker focuses on raw strength, pushing and stabilizing the stone<br></li><li>Foreman controls positioning with tools that boost, guide, and clear the path</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the interaction between these roles is the heart of Pyramidion\u2019s co-op design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Physics That Punish Mistakes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stone obeys physics at all times. Its weight, momentum, and balance are unforgiving. A single slip, mistimed push, or poor angle can undo minutes of careful progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is dramatic, but always fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Persistence, Not Perfection</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints ensure that failure never feels final. You will fall, recover, and try again, each attempt sharpening your teamwork and understanding of the climb ahead.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic checkpoints reduce frustration<br></li><li>Every retry improves coordination<br></li><li>Teamwork matters more than speed</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A Climb Worth Completing</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the summit is not about reflexes or precision alone. It is about patience, communication, and learning to move as a single unit under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend. Trust each other. And whatever you do, don\u2019t drop the stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Motivation Will Continue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/facde0f3f6fb58fe6d1e2631d6611dc539ae9973.jpg"},{"name":"Pharaoh's Penthouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/e9a301f8009d856dd3c16720b4ae9541b9946457.jpg"},{"name":"Yeet!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/69013f8c34113773c1cf1a9ae22620f5448716ba.jpg"},{"name":"Apes Together Strong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/5b63ae236bb90c3214d3f595aff3edf8c60d11cd.jpg"},{"name":"No Pain Rocky!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/37454454419bd714ef44e01429e9f042f72767ef.jpg"},{"name":"Sisyphus Reborn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/fe6bdd8a0dfaf89d00753b8ad6ce844cef08bd11.jpg"},{"name":"Need a Nap?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/fd1b0e34370c68d07728246aa1aa0fd772413567.jpg"},{"name":"With Friends Like These...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/6ffd005f471f311e6686da8e219a0975df18b9b6.jpg"},{"name":"Fragile Cargo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/aebe04be22ee69be5211f3353847611dfa0f1398.jpg"},{"name":"Mummy Dearest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/73ef64465d0ca356d70c9f4297fc04df8313ef79.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024600?t=1768212542","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024600?t=1768212542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/5605c4174728662f688500e6445e2e945f6a79b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768212542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/5605c4174728662f688500e6445e2e945f6a79b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768212542","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Two players. One stone. One summit.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pyramidion is a 2-player co-op physics challenge built entirely around coordination, timing, and trust. Together, you must haul a massive stone block from the base of a monolithic pyramid all the way to its summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step upward is a test of communication. Every mistake is paid for in momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/075a162e510fd939c4673caf7a3bbe71.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/075a162e510fd939c4673caf7a3bbe71.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/075a162e510fd939c4673caf7a3bbe71.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Distinct Roles, Shared Responsibility</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player takes on a unique role, and success depends on how well you combine your abilities. There is no solo play here. Progress only happens when both players act as one.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Worker focuses on raw strength, pushing and stabilizing the stone<br></li><li>Foreman controls positioning with tools that boost, guide, and clear the path</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the interaction between these roles is the heart of Pyramidion\u2019s co-op design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Physics That Punish Mistakes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stone obeys physics at all times. Its weight, momentum, and balance are unforgiving. A single slip, mistimed push, or poor angle can undo minutes of careful progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is dramatic, but always fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Persistence, Not Perfection</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints ensure that failure never feels final. You will fall, recover, and try again, each attempt sharpening your teamwork and understanding of the climb ahead.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic checkpoints reduce frustration<br></li><li>Every retry improves coordination<br></li><li>Teamwork matters more than speed</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A Climb Worth Completing</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the summit is not about reflexes or precision alone. It is about patience, communication, and learning to move as a single unit under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend. Trust each other. And whatever you do, don\u2019t drop the stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.poster.avif?t=1768212542\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.webm?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.mp4?t=1768212542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["TechDevAYDIN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/